    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121260/extras/53387f87421c9d4c92a2000f893afe2f.avif?t=1738001240\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121260/extras/17146a71f1a18b500b607e248e1826e4.poster.avif?t=1738001240\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121260/extras/17146a71f1a18b500b607e248e1826e4.webm?t=1738001240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121260/extras/17146a71f1a18b500b607e248e1826e4.mp4?t=1738001240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Rituality</strong> is an <i>accursed</i> dungeon crawler combining elements from party-based RPGs, roguelike ARPG combat and Immersive Sim interactivity. Use the mysterious power of the Evermend Lantern, gather your party and traverse the dungeon isles to cleanse and banish its cursed inhabitants. <br><br>We know no gods... Only myths.<br>Spirits whisper, folklore lurk in the shadows and the weak are possessed. Medicinal and ritual practice are one in the same, those devoted to contacting, harnessing and banishing the damned are known as <strong>Ritualists</strong>.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121260/extras/7ff326b7bf3280dc389812c9662ad13f.poster.avif?t=1738001240\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121260/extras/7ff326b7bf3280dc389812c9662ad13f.webm?t=1738001240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121260/extras/7ff326b7bf3280dc389812c9662ad13f.mp4?t=1738001240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u><i><strong>Real-time CRPG Combat</strong></i></u><br>Command your party in real-time combat, gain the advantage with <strong>Focus Mode</strong> to slow and stop time. Choose between <strong>5+ unique classes</strong> to make up your party bringing their own unique advantages and disadvantages, though be cautious as each expedition brings new challenges and those who fall in battle will be <strong>permanently removed</strong> from the party.<br><br><u><i><strong>Experiment with your environment</strong></i></u><br><strong>Everything is a weapon</strong>, all items can be equipped and have <strong>unique traits and actions</strong>.<br>Your party can <strong>grab, throw, carry and destroy</strong> many things. Out of ranged options?<i> Why not throw a barrel at the enemies!</i><br>Use the <strong>campfire</strong> to burn down objects in the world.<i> Maybe cook up a meal for the party or burn down a locked door that was too close to the fire!</i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121260/extras/722a68434b419545765623cbcabb62bc.poster.avif?t=1738001240\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121260/extras/722a68434b419545765623cbcabb62bc.webm?t=1738001240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121260/extras/722a68434b419545765623cbcabb62bc.mp4?t=1738001240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u><i><strong>Discover Powerful Curses</strong></i></u><br>Absorb cursed essence into your Evermend Lantern, the lantern shatters when filled condensing the essence into <strong>unique effects which can be engraved into your party and items</strong>. This power comes at a price, <strong>curse sickness</strong>. If not kept in check, it will lead to madness.<br><br><u><i><strong>Build up your town</strong></i></u><br>Claim the last sanctuary on the dungeon isle as your own, <strong>rebuild, recruit and expand your town</strong>.<br><strong>Investigate</strong> <i>Qurios </i>within the dungeon and uncover their secrets to further your sanctuary through use of the <i>dark arts</i>.",
