s</strong>. If not kept in check, it will lead to madness.<br><br><u><i><strong>Build up your town</strong></i></u><br>Claim the last sanctuary on the dungeon isle as your own, <strong>rebuild, recruit and expand your town</strong>.<br><strong>Investigate</strong> <i>Qurios </i>within the dungeon and uncover their secrets to further your sanctuary through use of the <i>dark arts</i>.",
